```

Note: The existing personas all use `silicon-amber` for their briefing card tags regardless of their individual persona colour. You may choose to either:
- (a) Keep this convention and use `silicon-amber` for Troy's tags too (consistent, simpler)
- (b) Use Troy's own `troy-blue` colour (differentiates him visually)

